MJW World Clock - licensing and attribution
=======================================

SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-only

The widget code in `content/` is a port of the desktop widgets of end4-pC
(https://github.com/pctrade/end4-pC), a maintained fork of the "illogical-impulse" Quickshell shell in
end-4/dots-hyprland (https://github.com/end-4/dots-hyprland). Both are GNU GPL v3; this plugin is therefore
conveyed under GPL-3.0 (see LICENSE). The original work is (c) its authors
(pctrade, end-4 and contributors).

Port notes:
- The illogical-impulse shell-wide singletons (Config, Appearance, GlobalStates,
  Directories, services) were replaced by plugin-local equivalents resolved
  from Ryoku's live theme daemon (Ryoku.PluginKit Scheme) and the ryoku-shell
  data topics, so the tile follows the desktop's palette, wallpaper and weather
  instead of a fixed fork config. No OpenWeather API key is required.
- Window/compositor access was removed entirely: placement, dragging, scaling
  and the lock screen belong to the Ryoku shell (docs/compositors.md), so this
  plugin runs on Hyprland and niri unchanged.
- Widget state (style picks, notes, todos, timers) is persisted under the
  plugin's own state dir ($XDG_STATE_HOME/ryoku/plugins/mjw-worldclock).

The MJW set was originally ported from https://github.com/neur0map/MJ-widgets (Material Junk Widgets, BSL-1.0)
under the name "Awe"; the illogical-impulse-based widgets replace the Awe
implementations where the upstream set has no equivalent (see
plugins/registry.json history).
